######## BALL TRAP ########

msgid "Description-Balltrap"
msgstr "A game where precision meets speed.\n"
"\n"
"Hit the lit segment in 1 or 2 darts to earn\n"
"1 or 2 Bonus throws at the Bull.\n"
"\n"
"The winner is the player with the most points at the end.\n"
"\n"
"-----\n"
"If you hit the lit segment with your 1st dart, you earn 2 points.\n"
"If you hit the lit segment with your 2nd dart, you earn 1 point.\n"
"* If you miss the lit segment with your first 2 darts, you\n"
"  lose your 3rd dart.\n"
"\n"
"If you hit the lit segment with your 1st dart, aim for the bull 2x.\n"
"If you hit the lit segment with your 2nd dart, aim for the bull 1x.\n"
"\n"
"- SB gives an extra 2 bonus points.\n"
"- DB gives an extra 3 bonus points.\n"
"\n"
"On rounds 3-6-9-12, 2 targets will launch at the same time.\n"
"\n"
"Targets can overlap; if you hit them simultaneously with\n"
"- your 1st dart, you get 2*2 points and a X2 bonus.\n"
"- your 2nd dart, you get 2*1 point and a X2 bonus.\n"
"otherwise, you get 2 points per target hit on the 1st try.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"- Time: Target movement speed.\n"
" "

msgid "Balltrap-Repetition"
msgstr "Repetition count"

msgid "Balltrap-Time"
msgstr "Target speed"

######## BASEBALL ########

msgid "Description-Baseball"
msgstr "The goal is to score maximum points in each inning.\n"
"Before scoring points, you must capture\n"
"3 bases or hit a Home Run.\n"
"\n"
"The winner is the player with the most points at the end.\n"
"\n"
"-----\n"
"Before scoring points, capture the first 3 bases\n"
"by hitting your assigned number (S = 1 base, D = 2 bases, T = 3 bases).\n"
"\n"
"You keep captured bases throughout the game, but opponents\n"
"can remove one or more bases by hitting your number.\n"
"\n"
"You score points when occupying 3 bases and hitting your number.\n"
"\n"
"Hitting SB gives a Home Run (+1 point), while DB gives a\n"
"Super Home Run (2 points), on top of your current bases.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"- 7th inning: Halves your score if you miss your segment.\n"
"- No tie: Plays extra innings in case of a tie.\n"
" "

msgid "Baseball-max_players"
msgstr "4 max"

msgid "Baseball-7eme_manche"
msgstr "7th inning"

msgid "Baseball-noequal"
msgstr "No tie"

msgid "Baseball-egalite"
msgstr "TIE - EXTRA INNING"

msgid "Baseball-septieme"
msgstr "Hit your number or your score will be divided by 2"

msgid "Baseball-team"
msgstr "Team game"

######## BATARD ########

msgid "Batard-name"
msgstr "Bastard"

msgid "Description-Batard"
msgstr "The first dart of the turn sets the base score. Each following point\n"
"must equal or exceed the previous dart's score.\n"
"\n"
"If lower than the previous dart, points are deducted.\n"
"\n"
"Highest score wins.\n"
"-----\n"
"Played over 10 rounds of 3 darts.\n"
"\n"
"The first dart opens the turn's score. Every following dart\n"
"must score equal to or higher than the previous dart.\n"
"\n"
"If the score is lower than the previous dart, it is deducted.\n"
"\n"
"Each turn resets the score requirement with the first dart.\n"
"\n"
"Out of bounds or a miss incurs a -10 point penalty.\n"
"\n"
"Highest score wins.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"- 1st dart: The 1st dart sets the required minimum score.\n"
"- Single bull: SB is worth 50 points.\n"
"- Penalty: Penalty value\n"
" "

msgid "Batard-simple50"
msgstr "Single Bull"

msgid "Batard-penality"
msgstr "Penalty"

msgid "Batard-first_dart"
msgstr "1st dart"

######## BERMUDE TRIANGLE ########

msgid "Bermuda_Triangle-name"
msgstr "Bermuda Triangle"

msgid "Description-Bermuda_Triangle"
msgstr "Don't get lost in the Bermuda Triangle.\n"
"\n"
"Complete various contracts throughout the game.\n"
"-----\n"
"Aim for the specified number or segment each round to build\n"
"maximum points.\n"
"\n"
"If you fail to hit the requested target, your total score\n"
"will be cut in half.\n"
"\n"
"Hit any double or triple when requested.\n"
"\n"
"Highest score wins the game.\n"
"\n"
"Option:\n"
"- Double bull: Enables/disables round 13 (DB).\n"
" "

msgid "Bermuda_Triangle-Double_bull"
msgstr "Enable/Disable double bull"

######## BIG 6 ########

msgid "Big6-name"
msgstr "Big 6"

msgid "Description-Big6"
msgstr "Players take turns aiming for the segment set by the previous player.\n"
"\n"
"You start with 3 lives; the first target to hit is segment S6.\n"
"\n"
"If you miss the target with all 3 darts, you lose a life.\n"
"\n"
