"One rule: score maximum points.\n"
"\n"
"Multiplier increases every time you hit a lit segment.\n"
"Hitting unlit segment scores 0 points and freezes multiplier.\n"
"\n"
"Highest total score wins.\n"
"-----\n"
"High Score game with point multipliers.\n"
"\n"
"One rule: score maximum points.\n"
"\n"
"Highest score wins.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"- Super Shoot-out: Same rules as classic Shoot-out, with a\n"
"  secondary multiplier increasing on lit hits. Unlit hits\n"
"  reset secondary multiplier to 1 (main multiplier stays).\n"
"- Segment: Disables exact hit segment (Single, Double, Triple)\n"
"  rather than whole number slice.\n"
" "

