msgstr "Number of segments (1-5)"

######## SLIDER ######

msgid "Description-Slider"
msgstr "First player to hit 20 (or Bull) wins.\n"
"\n"
"Start at number 10 (default); advance to next higher number\n"
"upon hitting target.\n"
"\n"
"Missing target with all 3 darts drops target down 1 number\n"
"on your next turn.\n"
"\n"
"Highest score wins.\n"
"-----\n"
"Hit requested number during your turn.\n"
"- Hit = Advance to next higher number.\n"
"- Miss with 3 darts = Drop down 1 number on next turn.\n"
"\n"
"Hit 20 (or Bull) to win.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"- Max rounds: Round count limit.\n"
"- Start: Starting number.\n"
"- Bull: Finish on bullseye.\n"
"- Master: Miss drops player down immediately.\n"
" "

