msgstr "Best of 1 set"

msgid "Tennis-set3"
msgstr "Best of 3 sets"

msgid "Tennis-set5"
msgstr "Best of 5 sets"

msgid "Tennis-retour"
msgstr "Return"

######## TOWER ######

msgid "Description-Tower"
msgstr "Save your princess!\n"
"\n"
"Rescue a princess locked in a tower\n"
"guarded by a dragon.\n"
"Prove your worth by completing 3 quests:\n"
"- Defeat dragon.\n"
"- Bring flower bouquet.\n"
"- Find lost tiara at assigned floor.\n"
"\n"
"Complete quests in any order.\n"
"\n"
"Knight who completes all 3 quests and reaches tower top wins.\n"
"-----\n"
"Knight who completes 3 quests and reaches top wins.\n"
"\n"
"Climb tower by hitting segment at tower base:\n"
"single=1 floor, double=2 floors, triple=3 floors.\n"
"\n"
"Fight dragon: Hit both requested segments in same turn.\n"
"Collect flowers: Hit requested segment twice in same turn.\n"
"Find tiara: Hit any double/triple on assigned floor.\n"
"SB hit: Drops all opponents down 1 floor.\n"
"DB hit: Cancels 1 opponent quest (flowers, then dragon).\n"
"\n"
"Miss hit: Player drops down 1 floor.\n"
"\n"
"Option:\n"
"- Dragon hard: 3 hits required to defeat dragon.\n"
" "

msgid "Tower-max_players"
msgstr "6 max"

msgid "Tower-dragon_hard"
msgstr "Hard dragon"

#########TREASURE HUNT #########

msgid "Description-Treasure"
msgstr "Grab detectors and search for grand treasures,\n"
"but beware of curses.\n"
"\n"
"Highest score wins.\n"
"-----\n"
"15 treasures hidden randomly on board each turn start.\n"
"\n"
"Hit numbers to uncover treasures:\n"
"\n"
"Chest X2, X3, X4, X5, X10: Multiplies segment value by X.\n"
"Diamond: Segment value equals 1000 points.\n"
"Ingot: Doubles total score.\n"
"Yellow Skull: Segment value equals -100 points.\n"
"Purple Skull: Segment value equals -300 points.\n"
"Red Skull: Segment value equals -500 points.\n"
"Blue Skull: Forfeits current turn.\n"
"Grenade: Segment value equals -1000 points.\n"
"Knife: Steals 300 points from opponent.\n"
"Sword: Steals 600 points from opponent.\n"
"Shield: Blocks all negative effects for 1 turn.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"- Rounds: Maximum number of rounds.\n"
"- Single Bull: SB worth 50 points.\n"
" "

msgid "Treasure-simple50"
msgstr "Single Bull"

msgid "Treasure-protect"
msgstr "Protected by your shield"

msgid "Treasure-protect2"
msgstr "Opponent protected by their shield"

######## UP DOWN COUNT UP ######

msgid "Description-Up_Down_Count_Up"
msgstr "Game alternates between positive and negative rounds.\n"
"\n"
"Highest score wins.\n"
"-----\n"
"Positive round: Points hit are added.\n"
"Negative round: Points hit are subtracted;\n"
" misses penalize 50 points.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"- Penalty: Miss penalty value.\n"
"- Negative start: Start game on negative round.\n"
" "

msgid "Up_Down_Count_Up-penalty"
msgstr "Penalty"

msgid "Up_Down_Count_Up-start_negative"
msgstr "Negative start"

msgid "UDCP-tourpos"
msgstr "Positive round"

msgid "UDCP-tourneg"
msgstr "Negative round"

######## VOLEUR ######

msgid "Voleur-name"
msgstr "The Thief"

msgid "Description-Voleur"
msgstr "Steal segments from opponents to block\n"
"them from playing those numbers.\n"
"\n"
"Highest score wins.\n"
"-----\n"
"On player's first turn only:\n"
"- Player randomly loses 1 to 3 segments.\n"
"\n"
"Then:\n"
"- Active player steals segments from next player.\n"
"- Last player steals segments from first player.\n"
"\n"
"- Hitting lit segment scores points and removes segment\n"
"  for next player (except Bull).\n"
"- Hitting unlit segment scores 0 points but removes segment\n"
"  for next player.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"- Rounds: Max round count.\n"
"- Single bull: SB worth 50 pts.\n"
" "

msgid "Voleur-simple50"
msgstr "Single bull worth 50 pts"

######## 321 ZLIP ######

msgid "Description-321_Zlip"
msgstr "Inverted 'Ho One' variant allowing you to reset\n"
"opponent's score to 0 by matching their score\n"
"(executing a \"Zlip\").\n"
"\n"
"Score exactly 321 points to win.\n"
"-----\n"
"Matching opponent's score resets their score to 0 (\"Zlip\").\n"
"\n"
"Busting past 321 subtracts excess points from 321.\n"
"You can hit a \"Zlip\" this way too.\n"
"\n"
"Reaching 321:\n"
"Classic: You win.\n"
"Master (without Zlip): Score resets to 0.\n"
"Master (with Zlip): You win.\n"
"Advanced (without Zlip): Score resets to 0 + 1 Zlip.\n"
"Advanced (with Zlip): You win.\n"
" "

msgid "321_Zlip-advanced"
msgstr "Advanced"

