msgid "Description-Yahtzydarts"
msgstr "Yahtzee converted to Yahtzydarts.\n"
"Game split into two parts like classic Yahtzee:\n"
"\n"
"Upper section: Hit dedicated numbers to score.\n"
"Earn bonus points if score equals or exceeds\n"
"target threshold in Bonus box.\n"
"\n"
"Lower section: Complete combinations (three of a kind,\n"
"four of a kind, etc.) to score.\n"
"-----\n"
"Throw 2 to 5 darts to form combination depending on hit segment:\n"
"\n"
"- Single = 1 die of hit number.\n"
"- Double = 2 dice of hit number.\n"
"- Triple = 3 dice of hit number.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: If holding 3 dice and hitting triple,\n"
"you only gain 2 dice (5 dice maximum limit).\n"
"\n"
"Missing required numbers yields a 0-value die;\n"
"though a miss, it can still complete combinations.\n"
"\n"
"To validate combination, tap flashing segment manually\n"
"(or aim for it!)\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"- Videos: Show/hide video animations."

